This Terraform program sets up two Elastic Beanstalk environments named "us_west" and "eu_central" in the respective AWS regions "us-west-2" and "eu-central-1". It also configures a Route53 hosted zone and a Route53 record to route traffic to the closest environment based on geolocation.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
