This Terraform program creates a basic Amazon Kendra index with user group resolution configured using AWS Single Sign-On (SSO). It includes an IAM role necessary for Kendra to operate, with the appropriate assume role policy. The program ensures that all required attributes are specified and that dependencies between resources are correctly handled.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "kendra_index_role" {
  name = "kendra-index-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
