7. **EKS Identity Provider Config**: Configures an OIDC identity provider for the EKS cluster.
8. **Kubernetes Provider**: Configures the Kubernetes provider to communicate with the EKS cluster.
9. **Helm Provider**: Configures the Helm provider to communicate with the EKS cluster.

Make sure to replace placeholder values like `vpc-12345678`, `example-client-id`, and `https://example.com` with actual values relevant to your environment.

