- **Subnet and Security Group**: Replace `"subnet-12345678"` and `["sg-12345678"]` with your actual subnet ID and security group IDs.
- **Volume Size**: The default volume size is set to 5 GB. You can adjust this as needed.
- **Direct Internet Access**: This is set to "Enabled". Change it to "Disabled" if you need to restrict internet access.

