### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "my_custom_ttl_bucket" {
  bucket = "my-custom-ttl-bucket-unique-name"
  acl    = "private"

