### Description
This Terraform program sets up an infrastructure for an autograder using AWS CodeBuild. It includes:
- An AWS CodeBuild project configured to run students' code from a GitHub repository.
- An IAM role with the necessary permissions for the CodeBuild project.
- An S3 bucket to store the build artifacts.
- A Secrets Manager secret to store GitHub credentials securely.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "autograder_codebuild_role" {
  name = "autograder_codebuild_role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "codebuild.amazonaws.com"
        }
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "autograder_artifacts_bucket" {
  bucket = "autograder-artifacts-bucket"
}

resource "aws_secretsmanager_secret" "autograder_github_token" {
  name = "autograder_github_token"
}

resource "aws_codebuild_project" "autograder_codebuild_project" {
  name         = "cs_class_autograder"
  service_role = aws_iam_role.autograder_codebuild_role.arn

  source {
    type            = "GITHUB"
    location        = "https://github.com/example/repo.git"
    git_clone_depth = 1
    report_build_status = true
  }

  artifacts {
    type = "S3"
    location = aws_s3_bucket.autograder_artifacts_bucket.bucket
  }

  environment {
    compute_type = "BUILD_GENERAL1_SMALL"
    image        = "aws/codebuild/amazonlinux2-x86_64-standard:3.0"
    type         = "LINUX_CONTAINER"
  }

  vpc_config {
    security_group_ids = ["sg-0123456789abcdef0"]
    subnets            = ["subnet-0123456789abcdef0"]
    vpc_id             = "vpc-0123456789abcdef0"
  }
}
```

### Notes
- **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-east-1` region.
- **IAM Role**: The IAM role `autograder_codebuild_role` allows CodeBuild to execute.
- **S3 Bucket**: The S3 bucket `autograder-artifacts-bucket` stores the build artifacts.
- **Secrets Manager Secret**: The secret `autograder_github_token` stores GitHub credentials.
- **CodeBuild Project**: The CodeBuild project `cs_class_autograder` is configured to pull code from a GitHub repository and store artifacts in the S3 bucket. The VPC configuration is set with placeholder values (`sg-0123456789abcdef0`, `subnet-0123456789abcdef0`, `vpc-0123456789abcdef0`) which should be replaced with actual values from your AWS account.

