This Terraform program sets up the infrastructure for a video streaming site that distributes video content globally. It uses AWS CloudFront, AWS Route53, and AWS S3. The program creates an S3 bucket to store video content, a CloudFront distribution to serve the content with global reach, and a Route53 zone and record to map a domain name to the CloudFront distribution.

