### Description
This Terraform program sets up a dedicated-tenancy AWS VPC with DNS support and hostnames enabled. It includes an internet gateway and a route table configured for outbound internet access. All resources are tagged with a variable name provided during deployment. The program ensures proper dependency management between resources to maintain a functional VPC setup.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"  # Default AWS region
}

variable "vpc_name" {
  description = "Name to tag the VPC resources"
  default     = "my-dedicated-vpc"
